Love Lyrics re-implements, in C++/QML, ideas and logic from Folia. No Folia code
is included verbatim. Files whose logic follows a Folia source file name that
file in their header. In particular:

  - src/lyrics/LrcParser.cpp
      src/utils/lyrics/parserCore.ts        (LRC / enhanced LRC timestamp rules)
      src/utils/lyrics/timelineSplitter.ts  (original + translation sharing a
                                             timestamp; blank-line handling)
      src/utils/lyrics/estimatedLineTiming.ts (line end estimation, weighted
                                             word timing for CJK / Latin)
  - src/lyrics/TextDecoding.cpp
      src/utils/lyrics/lyricFileDecoding.ts (BOM -> strict UTF-8 -> GB18030,
                                             line ending normalisation)
  - src/lyrics/LyricsCursor.cpp
      src/components/visualizer/runtime.ts  (active / upcoming line rules)

Visual styles are re-creations of motion seen in Folia's visualizer modes, built
from scratch in QML.
